14		<style>
15			:root {
16				color-scheme: light dark;
17				--text: #1a1a1a;
18				--text-secondary: #555;
19				--background: #fff;
20				--surface: #fff;
21				--accent: #0052a3;
22				--border: #e0e0e0;
23			}
24			@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
25				:root {
26					--text: #e0e0e0;
27					--text-secondary: #a0a0a0;
28					--background: #121212;
29					--surface: #1e1e1e;
30					--accent: #5fa3ff;
31					--border: #333;
32				}
33			}
34			*,
35			*::before,
36			*::after {
37				box-sizing: border-box;
38			}
39			html {
40				-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
41				text-size-adjust: 100%;
42			}
43			@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
44				html {
45					scroll-behavior: smooth;
46				}
47				a {
48					transition: text-decoration-thickness 0.15s ease;
49				}
50				.skip-link {
51					transition: transform 0.15s ease;
52				}
53				button,
54				.button {
55					transition: opacity 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
56				}
57			}
58			body {
59				display: grid;
60				grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
61				grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
62				min-height: 100vh;
63				min-height: 100dvh;
64				font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
65				font-size: 1rem;
66				line-height: 1.6;
67				overflow-wrap: break-word;
68				max-width: 70ch;
69				margin: 0 auto;
70				padding: clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem);
71				padding-top: max(clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem), env(safe-area-inset-top));
72				padding-right: max(clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem), env(safe-area-inset-right));
73				padding-bottom: max(clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem), env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
74				padding-left: max(clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem), env(safe-area-inset-left));
75				color: var(--text);
76				background: var(--background);
77			}
78			h1 {
79				color: var(--accent);
80				font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.25rem + 3vw, 2.5rem);
81				font-weight: 700;
82				line-height: 1.1;
83				text-wrap: balance;
84				margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
85				letter-spacing: -0.02em;
86			}
87			h2 {
88				color: var(--accent);
89				font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1rem + 1.5vw, 1.75rem);
90				font-weight: 600;
91				line-height: 1.2;
92				text-wrap: balance;
93				margin: 2rem 0 1rem 0;
94				letter-spacing: -0.01em;
95			}
96			h2:first-child {
97				margin-top: 0;
98			}
99			p {
100				text-wrap: pretty;
101				margin: 1rem 0;
102				line-height: 1.65;
103			}
104			a {
105				color: var(--accent);
106				text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
107				text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
108				text-decoration-skip-ink: auto;
109				font-weight: 500;
110			}
111			a:hover, a:active {
112				text-decoration-thickness: 3px;
113			}
114			button,
115			.button {
116				display: inline-block;
117				text-decoration: none;
118				padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
119				font-size: 1rem;
120				font-weight: 500;
121				font-family: inherit;
122				color: var(--background);
123				background: var(--accent);
124				border: 2px solid var(--accent);
125				border-radius: 0.25rem;
126				cursor: pointer;
127				white-space: nowrap;
128			}
129			button:hover,
130			.button:hover {
131				opacity: 0.85;
132				text-decoration: none;
133			}
134			button:active,
135			.button:active {
136				transform: scale(0.97);
137			}
138			ul, ol {
139				margin: 1rem 0;
140				padding-left: 2rem;
141			}
142			li {
143				margin: 0.75rem 0;
144				line-height: 1.6;
145			}
146			:focus-visible {
147				outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
148				outline-offset: 2px;
149			}
150			a:not(.button):focus-visible {
151				border-radius: 2px;
152			}
153			.skip-link {
154				position: absolute;
155				left: 0;
156				top: 0;
157				transform: translateY(-100%);
158				background: var(--accent);
159				color: var(--background);
160				padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
161				z-index: 1000;
162				border-radius: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
163				font-weight: 600;
164				text-decoration: none;
165				display: inline-block;
166			}
167			.skip-link:focus {
168				transform: none;
169				outline: 3px solid var(--text);
170				outline-offset: -3px;
171			}
172			header {
173				padding-block: 1.5rem 0;
174			}
175			main {
176				padding: 1rem 0;
177			}
178			main:focus {
179				outline: none;
180			}
181			section {
182				margin: 2rem 0;
183			}
184			.card {
185				border: 1px solid var(--border);
186				border-radius: 0.5rem;
187				padding: 1.5rem;
188				background: var(--surface);
189				margin: 1.5rem 0;
190			}
191			.card h3 {
192				font-size: 1.25rem;
193				line-height: 1.3;
194				text-wrap: balance;
195				margin-top: 0;
196				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
197				color: var(--accent);
198			}
199			.visually-hidden {
200				position: absolute;
201				width: 1px;
202				height: 1px;
203				margin: -1px;
204				padding: 0;
205				overflow: hidden;
206				clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
207				white-space: nowrap;
208				border: 0;
209			}
210			@media (prefers-contrast: more) {
211				:root {
212					--border: currentColor;
213				}
214				button,
215				.button {
216					border-width: 3px;
217				}
218				.card {
219					border-width: 2px;
220				}
221			}
222			footer {
223				padding-block: 1.5rem;
224				border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
225				font-size: 0.875rem;
226				color: var(--text-secondary);
227				text-align: center;
228			}
229			footer p {
230				margin: 0.5rem 0;
231			}
232			small {
233				display: block;
234			}
235			@media print {
236				:root {
237					color-scheme: light;
238					--text: #000;
239					--text-secondary: #333;
240					--background: #fff;
241					--surface: #fff;
242					--accent: #000;
243					--border: #999;
244				}
245				.skip-link,
246				button,
247				.button {
248					display: none;
249				}
250				body {
251					display: block;
252					min-height: 0;
253					max-width: none;
254					padding: 0;
255				}
256				a {
257					color: inherit;
258					text-decoration: underline;
259				}
260				a[href^="http"]::after {
261					content: " (" attr(href) ")";
262					font-size: 0.85em;
263					font-weight: normal;
264				}
265				.card {
266					border: none;
267					break-inside: avoid;
268				}
269			}
270		</style>
271	</head>
272	<body>
273		<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
274		<header>
275			<h1>Welcome</h1>
276		</header>
277		<main id="main" tabindex="-1">
278			<section aria-label="Introduction">
279				<p>This is a well-structured, accessible HTML5 document demonstrating modern best practices for semantic markup and inclusive design.</p>
280				<p>
281					It uses semantic landmarks, a skip link for keyboard navigation,
282					and CSS that adapts to your light or dark mode preference.
283				</p>
284				<p>
285					Text and link colors meet WCAG AA contrast in both themes, type scales
286					with your browser's font size, and motion respects your system settings.
287				</p>
288			</section>
289	
290			<section aria-labelledby="features">
291				<h2 id="features">Features</h2>
292				<ul>
293					<li>Semantic HTML structure with proper landmarks</li>
294					<li>Keyboard accessible navigation and focus management</li>
295					<li>Dark mode support with custom color schemes</li>
296					<li>Responsive typography using modern CSS</li>
297					<li>Print-friendly styles for better readability</li>
298					<li>WCAG AA contrast compliance in all color modes</li>
299				</ul>
300			</section>
301	
302			<section aria-labelledby="examples">
303				<h2 id="examples">Examples</h2>
304				<article class="card">
305					<h3>Component Cards</h3>
306					<p>Card components are useful for organizing related content. They include a subtle border and padding for visual separation.</p>
307					<a class="button" href="#resources">Learn more<span class="visually-hidden"> about accessibility resources</span></a>
308				</article>
309	
310				<article class="card">
311					<h3>Interactive Elements</h3>
312					<p>Buttons and links are fully accessible with clear focus states. The “Learn more” button above demonstrates smooth transitions and proper visual feedback.</p>
313					<p>Try using the Tab key to navigate through all interactive elements.</p>
314				</article>
315			</section>
316	
317			<section aria-labelledby="resources">
318				<h2 id="resources">Resources</h2>
319				<p>Want to learn more about web accessibility and semantic HTML? Check out these resources:</p>
320				<ul>
321					<li><a href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/quickref/">WCAG 2.2 Quick Reference</a></li>
322					<li><a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/">HTML Living Standard</a></li>
323					<li><a href="https://www.a11y-101.com/">A11y 101</a></li>
324				</ul>
325			</section>
326		</main>
327		<footer>
328			<p><small>&copy; <time datetime="2026">2026</time>. All rights reserved.</small></p>
329		</footer>
330	</body>
331	</html>
